&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Robotics Data Engineer (m/f/d) Data Generation &amp;amp; Curation&lt;/strong&gt;, who will build the pipeline that records, curates, and prepares multimodal robot datasets for foundation-model training. The pipeline has to run across different robot setups and combine real recordings with synthetic data from simulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multimodal Capture:&lt;/strong&gt; Build ROS 2 based capture for RGB and RGB-D cameras, wrist cameras, joint encoders, force-torque sensors, and teleoperation signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synchronization:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep multimodal streams time-aligned through sensor synchronization, calibration, and timestamp integrity checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and run health checks that detect dropped frames, sync drift, corrupt frames, and missing modalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset Curation:&lt;/strong&gt; Filter and deduplicate recorded data, maintain dataset metadata, and define train and evaluation splits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthetic Data Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate synthetic data generated in simulation into the same datasets and formats as real recordings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preprocessing:&lt;/strong&gt; Build preprocessing that aligns, slices, and inspects recorded episodes into a form that foundation-model training can use directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formats &amp;amp; Release:&lt;/strong&gt; Design dataset schemas and storage formats, version datasets so experiments can be reproduced, and package them for external release where approved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Robotics, Electrical Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent qualification plus professional experience building comparable data or robotics software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROS 2 Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience building sensor recording or data pipelines in ROS 2 with Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sensor Synchronization:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience synchronizing multiple cameras and sensors, including calibration and handling timestamp drift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset Schemas:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing schemas and storage layouts for multimodal time-series data, in formats such as Parquet, Zarr, or HDF5.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camera Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Working knowledge of camera pipelines and video encoding, and how they affect data size and frame integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dataset Curation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building curation steps for machine learning datasets, such as filtering, deduplication, and split design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthetic Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with combining simulated and real data in one training dataset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C++ Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing C++ for performance-critical capture or driver code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robot Learning Datasets:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with dataset conventions used in robot learning, such as LeRobot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teleoperation Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience recording teleoperation data for imitation learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
